        Instrumented jpxl bench --diag on 4000x3000 test-set image (log
        .agent/scratch/phase0-diag-12mp-20260806T084836Z.log). Modular: residual_scans=69,
        plane_clone_bytes=10080000000 (~10.08 GiB traffic), wall ~44.2s threads=1 vs
        ~43.2s auto (fingerprint identical). VarDCT defaults labeled fixed: choose_total=
        372874320 with cover=105934500 cfl_y=11812500 cfl_factor=219689820 final=35437500
        other=0; stage_ms cover~3.8 cfl~4.7-5.0 quant~0.82 entropy~3.7-3.9; cand_bytes=
        430464000 sel_bytes=144000000 cfl_sample_bytes=384000000; wall ~14.7s threads=1
        vs ~15.0s auto (no planning speedup). Confirms outside-advice static counts and
        that rayon emit does not move the VarDCT wall.
        """
