record jpegxl-rs.observation.realworld-encode-vs-cjxl-2026-08-06/1 : observation {
    title "Real-world encode times: test-set vs cjxl (0.8/4/12 MP)"
    state verified
    statement """
        On host dk-82y3 (nproc=20), jpxl 0.1.0 and cjxl v0.13.0, median wall after
        warm+3: 4000x3000 modular 38.0s / 9.80 MB vs cjxl -d0 -e7 1.24s / 6.92 MB
        and -d0 -e1 0.32s / 9.87 MB; VarDCT-fixed (defaults) 14.4s / 1.53 MB vs
